                that surface what's actually needed, and stay close enough to the technical side to know when
                something's realistic and when it isn't.
            </p>

            <p>
                FunduLwazi, my AI-powered document intelligence platform, is the clearest example of that approach
                in action: a real business problem, worked through from requirements to a deployed solution.
